// The game's user-facing DISPLAY name: the home-screen label
// (CFBundleDisplayName) and the Info.plist GameName key that
// Engine/Core/GameIdentity.swift reads at runtime. Change it here and both
// follow — no Swift edit needed.
//
// The target, folder, scheme and product are ALSO named "Liberty Line", by
// deliberate choice: name-agnostic structure ("Mobile App") made the app too
// hard to identify in Xcode and App Store Connect. A future game rename
// therefore means editing this value AND renaming the target/folder/scheme,
// plus the App Store Connect product name. The database
// (in_defense_of_history.sqlite) and title asset (game_title) stay
// name-agnostic so data and art identifiers never churn.
GAME_DISPLAY_NAME = Liberty Line
